        <mxCell id="card-data-plane" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#22d3ee&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Request path · data plane&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; A signed-in user calls https://&amp;lt;app&amp;gt;.staging.acme.example/api. TLS already ended at the edge team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; eg checks the GitLab id-token cookie and the route&amp;#39;s allowedGroups, then proxies plain HTTP to the backend Service.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; The backend queries its own CNPG cluster with DATABASE_URL.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt; It calls another app on its public hostname from &amp;lt;APP&amp;gt;_URL. hostAliases pins that name to eg-internal, which routes /api only.&lt;br&gt;• Other apps call this one the same way, unauthenticated.&lt;br&gt;• To verify: whether the id-token cookie reaches the backend, i.e. whether the app can read the user&amp;#39;s identity.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="560" y="1390" width="520" height="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-control-plane" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#a78bfa&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Background · control plane&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• Argo CD renders generic-app-chart: team values from app-configs first, platform baseline last, so the baseline wins on images, security and vault[].&lt;br&gt;• The migration Job runs as a PreSync hook before each rollout.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt; VSO reads the app&amp;#39;s Vault path with the role pinned by the baseline, and writes it as a K8s Secret.&lt;br&gt;• CNPG creates &amp;lt;app&amp;gt;-db and publishes &amp;lt;app&amp;gt;-db-app, the source of DATABASE_*.&lt;br&gt;• Image Updater bumps the image tag in app-configs on every rc build.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1100" y="1390" width="460" height="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-contract" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#818cf8&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Runtime contract · what the pod sees&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Env, always:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; APP_NAME, APP_COMPONENT, APP_ENV, APP_DOMAIN, POD_NAME, POD_NAMESPACE, LOG_LEVEL.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Env, database:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; DATABASE_HOST, _PORT, _NAME, _USER, _PASSWORD, _URL (driver from urlScheme).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Env, other apps:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &amp;lt;APP&amp;gt;_URL for the 8 known apps, e.g. BOOKING_URL=http://booking.staging.acme.example.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Secrets:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; each vault[] entry becomes a Secret, injected as env via injectInto. No files, no Vault token. Rotation needs a restart.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Sandbox:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; non-root uid 1000, read-only root, writable /tmp 64Mi, all capabilities dropped, seccomp RuntimeDefault.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Must expose:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; HTTP on 8000 (backend) or 8080 (frontend), /health/live, /health/ready, /metrics. JSON logs on stdout.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Sizing:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; 1 replica, 100m/128Mi request, 500m/512Mi limit, required anti-affinity.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1580" y="1390" width="620" height="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-gaps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Gaps between docs and code&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;G1&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;East-west auth.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; eg-internal has no SecurityPolicy. Any app pod can call any app&amp;#39;s /api, and the callee cannot tell who is calling.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;G2&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;No broker.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Docs promise RabbitMQ with one vhost per app. Not deployed, RABBITMQ_URL not injected, egress rule off. The template&amp;#39;s publisher and worker cannot run.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;G3&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Archetype vs contract.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Backends serve /health and /ready, not /health/live and /health/ready. Frontends run stock nginx as root on port 80.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;G4&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Observability.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; /metrics is required but no Prometheus runs. Logs only through kubectl.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;G5&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Durability.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; The DB sits on local-path (node-pinned), backups off. FLIGHT_TRACKING_URL is injected but that app does not exist.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2220" y="1390" width="580" height="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
